{
    "title": "IQ Test: Logic brain training",
    "description": "Welcome to the IQ test! With our brain games, riddle games and iq games(intelligence quotient), you can measure your intellectual capacity while train your brain with our iq games and brain test.\r\n\r\nThis is a Brain training games having a lot of brain exercises and mind games to prepare for a real iq test.\r\n\r\nMost population has an approximate IQ between 90 and 110. Train your brain and take an iq test to know your IQ score. IQ of famous people:\r\n\r\n- Albert Einstein IQ 175\r\n- Leonardo da Vinci IQ 185\r\n- Bill Gates IQ 160\r\n- Stephen Hawking IQ 160\r\n\r\nTake a quick IQ test to find out your IQ, just 30 minutes for 40 questions of riddle games, logic games and maths games. With 4 IQ tests of riddle games, maths games for adults and logic games you have a very rough idea of the real IQ.\r\n\r\nIQ Test: Logic brain games for adults include different categories such as:\r\n\r\n\u2713 IQ test\r\n\u2713 Memory training games\r\n\u2713 IQ Games\r\n\u2713 Brain training games\r\n\u2713 Logic puzzle riddles\r\n\u2713 Mind games\r\n\r\nDo you want to prepare for your next logical iq test? We have created this brain booster app to impulse your brain with our riddles games and free iq test and be able to face the iq test.\r\n\r\nImpulse brain training and improve your intelligence with our logic games, brain games and logic riddle puzzle that will challenge your IQ. Challenge your friends with our IQ test app and iq games for adults with logic iq test. They will impulse iq, improve memory and logic.\r\n\r\nFor many jobs you will be given aptitude tests, psycho-technical test or psychological tests. Get ready for these IQ tests or brain test with our riddles games, logic games and iq games. Your future career may depend on it, practice the brain games for adults.\r\n\r\nThis memory skill game will increase your mind skills and improve your brain to solve Logic Puzzles and brain games.\r\n\r\nPerform iq test with riddle games and logic games and compete with your friends to train your brain. You can compete the iq games for adults and see who is smarter. Play our brain games to boost your IQ and improve your iq test results.\r\n\r\nDownload the IQ Test: Logic brain trainer and share with your family our math riddles games and our iq tests for adults.\r\n\r\nYou will get a certificate with your approximate IQ that you can send so that your friends and family can also train your brain with this iq test app and logic games.\r\n\r\nPractice with our iq game and brain games for adults and you will get a better result. Or just enjoy our math puzzles and boost your brain so it doesn't age.\r\n\r\nThis iq test is suitable for all adult ages:\r\n\r\n-Young: Prepare your IQ test to start your first job.\r\n-Middle Age: The brain booster does not have to stop. Train your brain with our math puzzles, riddles games and logic games.\r\n-Advanced age: Our elders have to train your brain to keep it healthy and young. These iq test and memory training games will make it possible.\r\n\r\nTo prevent brain aging it is essential to train the brain booster. With this math game for adults and our logic and IQ test games we will be able to train our brain so that it does not get sick and stays young.\r\n\r\nPlaying brain games, iq test and math puzzles you can improve your memory and train your brain.\r\n\r\nAre you preparing for an iq test for a job or an entrance exam? Practice with our IQ test app, with its riddles games and logic games you will achieve a better score.\r\n\r\nImproving our IQ is possible, we have to play logic games, riddles and math games for adults to train the brain and keep it young. Each IQ test or riddle we do will get a better score and we will improve our memory and our spatial perception. Brain booster will be improved with this iq test app, riddle games and logic games. Never stop making math games for adults and you will continue to improve in all aspects of intelligence.\r\n\r\nDifferent kinds of Logic puzzles, Brain game, and thinking games will increase your mental ability and memory skills.\r\n\r\nEnjoy this iq test and brain training! New iq games, maths games and logic riddles puzzle every update!",
